Privacy Policy - ELX CPR
Last updated: 4 November 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how the ELX CPR mobile application ("the app"), published by Dartwings ("we", "us"), handles information. The app is a training companion for the ELX CPR Bluetooth training manikin.

1. Information we collect
We do not collect, store on our servers, sell or share any personal information. The app has no user accounts, no advertising and no analytics or tracking.

2. Information stored on your device
To provide training results and reports, the app stores the following only on your device:
- Trainee details you choose to enter before a session (such as name, age, gender, training level and optional notes)
- CPR session results (compression depth, rate, recoil, hand position, rescue breaths, scores and session duration)
- App settings (such as language and voice coaching preferences)
This information never leaves your device unless you choose to share a report. You can delete sessions in the app, or remove all app data by clearing the app's storage or uninstalling the app.

3. Bluetooth and location
The app uses Bluetooth Low Energy to find and connect to the ELX CPR training manikin and to receive training data from it. On Android 11 and lower, Android requires location permission to scan for Bluetooth devices. The app does not access, use, store or share your location.

4. Reports and sharing
PDF session reports are created on your device. A report is shared only when you choose to share it, using the share option of your device. Once shared, the report is handled by the app or service you selected.

5. Voice coaching
Voice prompts are played using your device's built-in text-to-speech engine. The app does not record audio and does not use the microphone.

6. Third parties
The app does not include advertising, analytics or third-party tracking services, and does not send your data to any third party.

7. Children
The app is intended for CPR training by adults and instructors. It is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information from children.

8. Security
Because your data stays on your device, its security depends on your device's protection. We recommend using a screen lock on your device.

9. Medical disclaimer
ELX CPR is a training tool for practising CPR on a manikin. It is not a medical device and must not be used in a real emergency.

10. Changes to this policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.

11. Contact us
If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at selectrotechsolutions@gmail.com.
